For our location in Ghimbav (Romania) we are currently looking for a
 Global Logistics Specialist Planning & Customer Service
 Your Responsibilities
Reviewing, documenting and optimize logistical setups and processes for all global manufacturing plants, with a strong focus on production planning & customer support;
Developing and implementing standards, concepts and tools for SAP (PP/MM), in close collaboration with related stakeholders;
Implementing, optimizing and continuously monitoring defined measures, processes, and structures across global locations;
Offering cross-functional first-level-support as Group Key User in SAP PP/MM;
Providing short‑term development and implementation of solutions for complex operational or systemic issues;
Identifying bottlenecks and proposing corrective actions to improve efficiency;
Offering support for initiatives focused on streamlining planning accuracy and operational performance.
 YOUR PROFILE
Superior studies;
Previous experience within the Logistics department (minimum 3 years); 
Good SAP knowledge (modules: PP, MM, SD);
English knowledge at an advanced level;
German knowledge is a plus;
MS Office knowledge;
Good organizing, team work, communication and problem solving skills; 
Good negotiation skills;
Open to business travelling if needed.
